The legal texts in this repository are Mexican federal legislation. Under the Ley Federal del Derecho de Autor,
art. 14, fracción VIII, legislative, regulatory, administrative and judicial texts are not protected by
copyright.

The consolidated texts and the extractos come from the Suprema Corte de Justicia de la Nación, "Legislación"
(https://legislacion.scjn.gob.mx), retrieved in October 2026. Its terms (https://www.scjn.gob.mx/terminos-condiciones)
allow copying "con fines exclusivamente informativos, académicos, de orientación entre otros similares o
análogos", ask whoever reproduces or processes the information to cite its electronic location and the date of
consultation, and forbid commercialising the portal's information. Attribution:

    Suprema Corte de Justicia de la Nación. Legislación. <https://legislacion.scjn.gob.mx> [Consulta: octubre de 2026]

The official text is the one published in the Diario Oficial de la Federación. SCJN's editor's notes
("N. DE E.") are SCJN's, not law.

The scripts, the commit structure and the documentation are by Lexifina and may be reused under CC0 1.0.
This repository is private; reuse terms for a public release have not been decided.
